        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "When the Surf's Up, Cody Maverick comes running to hit the tubes with his board. Based on the 2007 film, Surf's Up follows the story of a young penguin surfer from Shiverpool Antarctica who enters the Big Z Memorial Surf Off on the island of Pen Gu. Single gamers may select from ten playable characters and then work their way through several environments including Shiverpool, Pen Gu, and the volcanic area. With friends, players may compete in a variety of competitions with such characters as Tank, Big Z, and Cody.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Cuando hay olas, Cody Maverick acude corriendo para meterse en los tubos de las olas con su tabla. Basado en la película de 2007, Surf's Up sigue la historia de un joven pingüino surfista de Shiverpool, en la Antártida, que participa en el Big Z Memorial Surf Off, en la isla de Pen Gu. Los jugadores en solitario pueden elegir entre diez personajes jugables y avanzar por varios entornos, como Shiverpool, Pen Gu y la zona volcánica. Con amigos, los jugadores pueden competir en diversas competiciones con personajes como Tank, Big Z y Cody.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2007",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
